      "description": "Watch FC Copenhagen vs Inter Turku highlights and goals from UEFA Europa Conference League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 27, 2026. The UEFA Conference League spotlight shone brightly on August 27, 2026 , as FC Copenhagen played host to Inter Turku in a compelling European fixture. Both sides aimed to assert their dominance in a match that promised tactical depth and high energy from the very first whistle. Breakthrough Before the Break The opening period was a tightly contested affair, with both teams fighting for every inch of grass. However, the deadlock was finally broken in the 41st minute. Marcos Lopez delivered a pinpoint cross that found the head of Gabriel Pereira , who powered his effort home to give FC Copenhagen the lead. The atmosphere grew increasingly tense as the half drew to a close, with the referee busy issuing yellow cards to Jussi Niska and Luka Kuittinen of Inter Turku , as well as Robert for the home side, following a series of robust challenges. Rapid Start and a Penalty Response The second half began with immediate fireworks. Just four minutes after the restart, Andreas Cornelius turned provider, setting up Mads Emil Madsen for a clinical left-footed finish that doubled the hosts' advantage. Despite trailing by two, Inter Turku refused to surrender and found a lifeline in the 69th minute. After being awarded a penalty, Jasse Tuominen stepped up and coolly converted with his right foot, sending Diant Ramaj the wrong way to make it 2-1. Clem’s Stunner and Late Misfortune Any hopes of a comeback for the visitors were extinguished in the 78th minute by a moment of individual brilliance. Mohamed Elyounoussi teed up William Clem , who unleashed a magnificent strike from outside the box that flew into the net. The goal restored the two-goal cushion and allowed the hosts to manage the closing stages with confidence, introducing veteran Thomas Delaney to stabilize the midfield. In the dying moments of stoppage time, disaster struck for the visitors. In the 90+3rd minute, Prosper Ahiabu inadvertently diverted the ball into his own net, compounding the frustration for Inter Turku . The final whistle confirmed a 4-1 victory for FC Copenhagen , a result that reflected their clinical edge in a hard-fought encounter."
